    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;A. Specific support followed by reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Correct. The audience needs both detail and explanation.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;B. Unsupported main points.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Unsupported points leave the audience with questions.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;C. Transitions with no relationship.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Transitions should show relationships.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;D. Random examples.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Random examples weaken focus.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q18</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Question ID:&lt;/strong&gt; SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q18&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLA Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; MLA.SPEECH.PRES.02&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Which outline section is most complete?&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber>SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q18</idnumber>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>none</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;A. Point: practice.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;This is too vague because it does not state a complete informative point.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;B. Point: transition.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;This does not develop an informative idea.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;C. Point: stuff about notes.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;This is vague and incomplete because it gives no clear speaking cue.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;D. Point: rehearsal improves timing; support: time each section; reasoning: revise parts that run long.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Correct. It includes point, support, and reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q19</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Question ID:&lt;/strong&gt; SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q19&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLA Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; MLA.SPEECH.COM.02&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What makes support relevant?&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber>SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q19</idnumber>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>none</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;A. It is unrelated but interesting.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Unrelated support weakens focus.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;B. It is the longest sentence.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Length does not prove relevance.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;C. It directly explains or proves the speech point.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Correct. Relevant support connects to the point.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;D. It avoids the topic.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
      <feedback format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Support should stay on topic.&lt;/p&gt;</text></feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q20</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Question ID:&lt;/strong&gt; SPEECH_U02_L06_Quiz_Q20&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLA Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; MLA.SPEECH.SPK.01&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Which transition best moves from notes to rehearsal?&lt;/p&gt;</text>
